{
 "brief": "The Palestinian Petroleum Authority announced Monday that five trucks carrying cooking gas entered Gaza, Shehab Wire reported. The fuel will be distributed to residents according to publicly announced allocation lists, the authority said.\n\nThe delivery represents a rare shipment of cooking fuel into the blockaded territory. Gaza has faced severe shortages of essential supplies, including fuel and gas, for extended periods. The authority's announcement specified the distribution mechanism to ensure residents receive allocations according to official rosters compiled for the purpose.",
